{
  "$schema": "https://docs.renovatebot.com/renovate-schema.json",
  "extends": [
    "config:best-practices",
    ":pinDependencies",
    ":pinDevDependencies",
    "helpers:pinGitHubActionDigests"
  ],
  "lockFileMaintenance": {
    "enabled": true
  },
  "dependencyDashboard": true,
  "packageRules": [
    {
      "matchUpdateTypes": [
        "minor",
        "patch"
      ],
      "groupName": "all non-major dependencies",
      "groupSlug": "all-minor-patch",
      "matchPackageNames": [
        "!vue-server-renderer",
        "!vue-template-compiler",
        "!@nuxtjs/tailwindcss"
      ]
    },
    {
      "matchPackageNames": [
        "node",
        "@types/node"
      ],
      "allowedVersions": "<=24",
      "groupName": "Node.js"
    },
    {
      "matchPackageNames": [
        "vue",
        "vue-tsc"
      ],
      "allowedVersions": "<=3",
      "enabled": true,
      "groupName": "Vue.js"
    },
    {
      "matchPackageNames": [
        "@nuxt/devtools",
        "@nuxt/kit",
        "@nuxt/types",
        "nuxi",
        "nuxt"
      ],
      "enabled": true,
      "groupName": "Nuxt.js"
    },
    {
      "matchPackageNames": [
        "eslint",
        "@nuxt/eslint",
        "@nuxt/eslint-config",
        "@nuxt/eslint-plugin",
        "eslint-config-prettier",
        "eslint-plugin-prettier"
      ],
      "groupName": "ESLint",
      "groupSlug": "eslint",
      "separateMajorMinor": false,
      "separateMultipleMajor": false
    },
    {
      "matchPackageNames": [
        "graphql-request"
      ],
      "enabled": true
    },
    {
      "description": [
        "graphql v17 で追加された検証（interface 実装フィールドの deprecation 整合性チェック）に GitHub GraphQL API の公開スキーマ自体が違反しており（Project.id 等は deprecated だが interface の Node.id は非 deprecated）、graphql:schema / graphql:codegen が失敗するため v16 系に固定する。",
        "live introspection なのでスキーマ再生成では回避できず、GitHub 側の修正待ち。修正されたらこの allowedVersions を外して v17 へ再挑戦する。"
      ],
      "matchPackageNames": [
        "graphql"
      ],
      "allowedVersions": "<17"
    }
  ],
  "postUpdateOptions": [
    "yarnDedupeHighest"
  ]
}
